      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.8,
      "end_seconds": 268.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "mm. Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards post-viral fatigue. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.65,
      "end_seconds": 307.5,
      "duration_seconds": 26.85,
      "text": "we should do a thyroid test for fatigue. I want blood tests done, that's for fatigue. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Pace yourself, a little more activity each day but stop before you're wiped out. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.11,
      "end_seconds": 310.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "that's clear"
    },
